  "job_B15.8.89_20251003_114349": {
    "text": "\u00d0is syndon \u00fea land gem\u00e6ra to Myceldefer.\n\u00c6rest on hafoc hlinc \u00feonne swa andlang herpa\u00f0es on ecgulfes treow.\n\u00deonne andlang herpa\u00f0es o\u00f0 myceldefer.\n\u00deonne andlang myceldefer.\n\u00deonne of myceldefer to \u00f0am pole.\n\u00deonne of \u00f0am pole to n\u00e6san byrig.\n\u00deonne of n\u00e6san byrig to w\u00e6ter hlince.\n\u00deonne of w\u00e6ter hlince to stapola \u00f0orne.\n\u00deonne of stapola \u00f0orne to horgan wege.\n\u00d0onne of horgan wege to fors\u00e6\u00f0an pylle.\n\u00d0onne of fors\u00e6\u00f0an pylle to \u00f0yddan \u00feorne.\n\u00d0onne of \u00f0yddan \u00feorne to tettan grafe.\n\u00deonne of tettan grafe to ceortes beorge.\n\u00deonne of ceortes beorge to cleara flode.\n\u00deonne of cleara flode andlang str\u00e6te on herwes ham.\n\u00deonne of herwes ham to lin leage.\n\u00d0onne of lin leage to bulloces sole.\n\u00d0onne of bulloces sole to ticces ham.\n\u00deonne ofer \u00f0one feld to bearcelea.\n\u00deonne of bearcelea for\u00f0 on \u00e6p lea.\n\u00deonne of \u00e6p lea swa for\u00f0 on hean hangran \u00fe ofer \u00f0one feld on kendefer.\n\u00deonne andlang kendefer on duddan dune.\n\u00deonne andlang streames to brocenan beorge.\nOf brocenan beorge innan \u00f0a rode on beaga lea.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re rode on middeweardan weard hangran.\nOf weard hangran swa for\u00f0 on papan holt su\u00f0eweardne.\n\u00deonne on \u00f0\u00e6t gemot hus.\n\u00deonne ofer ruwan dune \u00fe eft on hafoc hlinc.\n\u00deis syndon \u00f0a land gem\u00e6ra to cramburnan, \u00e6rest on myceldeferes stream fornangean \u00f0one cyric stede\nOf waddan ige.\nAndlang streames on \u00f0one blacan pol.\nOf \u00f0am blacan pole.\nOn hwelpes dell.\nOf hwelpes delle on \u00f0one burnan.\nOf \u00f0am burnan nor\u00f0 andlang weges on tuccingc weg.\nOf tuccingc wege.\nAndlang weges on greatan dic.\nOf greatan dic on ruwan beorh.\nOf ruwan beorge \u00feur\u00f0 \u00feone wuda on cealc grafan andlang pa\u00f0es on friged\u00e6g.\nOf friged\u00e6ge on horweges nor\u00f0 ende.\nOf horweges nor\u00f0 ende andlang weges eastweard on \u00f0one smalan p\u00e6\u00f0.\nOf \u00f0am smalan p\u00e6\u00f0e ut \u00f0urh cealc grafas on \u00f0one readan pyll.\nOf \u00f0am readan pylle andlang fyr innan greatan dic on \u00fe\u00e6t smale dell.\nOf \u00f0am smalan delle ut to lytlan dune on \u00f0\u00e6s hundes hylle.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6s hundes hylle andlang weges on crammere.\nOf crammere andlang weges on nanes mannes land.\nOf nanes mannes land andlang weges eft innan myceldefer.\n\u00deis syndon \u00f0a land gem\u00e6ra to cu\u00f0redes hricgce.\n\u00c6rest of \u00f0am readan clife.\nIn to bican forda andlang weges to winter burnan.\nOf winter burnan on \u00f0a fearnigan hylle.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re fearnigan hylle ut on mattuces feld.\nOf mattuces felda up to \u00f0am garan on \u00fe\u00e6t twyslede treow.\nOf \u00f0am twysledan treowe to \u00f0am more.\nAnd ofer \u00f0one mor be eastan \u00f0an more on brom burnan.\nAndlang brom burnan to syle forda.\nOf syle forda eft to bican forda.\n\u00d0is syndon \u00f0a land gem\u00e6ra to deorleage.\n\u00c6rest on cysle burnan innan hamele \u00fe\u00e6r cysle burnan \u00e6rest in g\u00e6\u00f0.\nUp andlang cysle burnan to wifeles stigele.\nOf wifeles stigele on \u00fe\u00e6t read leafe treow.\nOf \u00f0am read leafan treowe on \u00f0one ealdan stocc.\nOf \u00f0am stocce be westan burnan on \u00feone grenan weg.\nOf \u00f0am grenan wege andlang \u00f0\u00e6s smalan pa\u00f0es to cnollgete.\nOf cnollgete on \u00fe\u00e6t hwite treow.\nOf \u00feam hwitan treowe on \u00f0\u00e6t nor\u00f0 healde treow.\nOf \u00f0am nor\u00f0 healdan treowe to cuntan heale.\nOf cuntan heale on \u00f0one lytlan wyll.\nOf \u00f0am lytlan wylle for\u00f0 ofer beorh holt on \u00f0a langan byrce.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re langan byrce innan wohburnan.\nAndlang wohburnan to stapol forda.\nUp of stapol forda to awelwican.\nOf awelwican into \u00f0am holan more.\nAndlang \u00f0\u00e6s holan mores innan hamele andlang hamele \u00fe\u00e6r cysle burnan g\u00e6\u00f0 into hamele.\n\u00deis syndon \u00f0a land gem\u00e6ra to rige leage.\n\u00c6rest on seaxea sea\u00f0.\nOf seaxe sea\u00f0e on \u00feone holan \u00e6sc.\nOf \u00f0am holan \u00e6sce on trindeleage.\nOf trindeleage on f\u00e6stan \u00e6c.\nOf f\u00e6stan \u00e6c on eadulfes hamm.\nOf eadulfes hamme on \u00f0a readan dic.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re readan dic on \u00fea leage.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re leage on b\u00e6r heal.\nOf b\u00e6r heale.\nOn t\u00e6ppe leage.\nOf t\u00e6ppe leage eft on seaxesea\u00f0.\nIN nomine Jhesu christi.\n\u00deis syndon \u00f0\u00e6ra syx hida land gem\u00e6ra \u00e6t kendefer.\nPrimitus.\nFram \u00f0\u00e6re burn stowe.\nTo \u00f0am stan cistele.\nAc deinde on \u00f0one greatan \u00feorn.\nIndeque.\nOn bican hyrste to wuda.\nSic deinceps to ruwan beorge.\nIllincque to \u00f0am widan herpa\u00f0e.\nSicque promtim.\nTo beofan stane to nor\u00f0 sceate to wuda.\nAnd \u00f0urh \u00f0one wuda inn on widan d\u00e6ll middewerd.\nEx hoc.\nUt \u00f0urh tigel hangran.\nEt de post ut \u00f0urh trindlea.\nSwa andlang \u00f0\u00e6s smalan weges to bucgan oran on \u00f0a miclan dic.\nSic denique andlang dune on west healfe to \u00f0\u00e6re burn stowe \u00f0e we \u00e6r on fruman nemdan, & \u00f0a seofan\nEall swa \u00f0a land gem\u00e6ra hit on butan belicgcea\u00f0.\nAnd an wer on ycenan & healf \u00fe\u00e6t hwite clif & ses sy\u00f0emyste mylen on winteceastre binnan wealle.",
